  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Documentation of 16th-18th-Century Naletale Cluster Drystone Masonry Sites</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Naletale Cluster in southern Zimbabwe consists of the remains of several drystone masonry walled sites that served as settlements between the 16th and 18th centuries. This project involves the comprehensive documentation and assessment of the sites.</narrative>
  </description>
